        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✨ a magical delivery dating sim</strong> ✨</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mari is a college-aged witch who returns home for the first time in years to help her dad's delivery service. While delivering packages, she meets some familiar faces from high school...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Mari's Magical Deliveries is a delivery dating sim where you deliver packages and fall in love!</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨ demo features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >half an hour for a bite-sized experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >meet all 3 love interests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a quick look at the delivery mechanics</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨ full game features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-3 hours of playtime (around 1 hour per route / playthrough)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >romance 3 characters (2 male, 1 female) with different endings for each</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >befriend lots of side characters along your deliveries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a point-and-click delivery system for exploring town and meeting others</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ability to customize your room with the money earned from deliveries</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563380/extras/d4fded02a6114afc0be4b889c8725166.avif?t=1765221371\" width=1560 height=1104 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✨ a magical delivery dating sim</strong> ✨</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mari is a college-aged witch who returns home for the first time in years to help her dad's delivery service. While delivering packages, she meets some familiar faces from high school...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Mari's Magical Deliveries is a delivery dating sim where you deliver packages and fall in love!</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨ demo features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >half an hour for a bite-sized experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >meet all 3 love interests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a quick look at the delivery mechanics</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨ full game features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-3 hours of playtime (around 1 hour per route / playthrough)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >romance 3 characters (2 male, 1 female) with different endings for each</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >befriend lots of side characters along your deliveries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a point-and-click delivery system for exploring town and meeting others</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ability to customize your room with the money earned from deliveries</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563380/extras/d4fded02a6114afc0be4b889c8725166.avif?t=1765221371\" width=1560 height=1104 /></span></p>",
